  "domainNote": "Third City batch (incident comment/visibility/upvote/merge, preventive maintenance schedule/schedule-check, asset document attach). Same validation/CAS pattern as the lifecycle batch; merge is the multi-record orchestration the generic dispatcher cannot express (fixed 5 duplicate slots, or-filter query reads, CAS close per slot, re-read before the primary annotation), and assets.document joins file metadata from the files capability to the asset record. Workflow nodes that call a common capability send X-Workspace-App: city because those records live in the app-scoped common tenant. Bundle workflowRef checksums for this batch pin the portable workflow graph checksum (sha256 over the canonical {nodes, connections, settings}); the pre-existing pins are import-time DX snapshots.",
